*** Settings ***
Documentation       TEMPLATE - rename to `.robot` once `requirements-api.txt` is installed.
...                 Kept with a `.example` suffix so it never breaks `robot --dryrun` in CI.

Library             RequestsLibrary
Library             Collections

Suite Setup         Create Session    api    ${API_BASE_URL}    verify=${CONFIG}[api][verify_ssl]

Test Tags           api


*** Test Cases ***
Health Endpoint Responds
    [Tags]    smoke
    ${response}=    GET On Session    api    /health    timeout=${CONFIG}[api][timeout]
    Status Should Be    200    ${response}
    Should Be Equal    ${response.json()}[status]    ok

Unauthenticated Request Is Rejected
    [Tags]    regression    negative
    ${response}=    GET On Session    api    /me    expected_status=401
    Status Should Be    401    ${response}
